        "original_id": "1ee54efe-e449-5216-8192-5f470807d5f1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tommy Gunn toy, Sterling submachine gun, Sten gun, L85A1 assault rifle\n- Organizations: British Army\n- Topics: British infantry uniforms, World War II equipment transitions\n\nFacts:\n- The Tommy Gunn toy basic doll depicted a British infantry soldier and included a Sterling submachine gun.\n- The Tommy Gunn toy was also sold in a World War II version that carried a Sten gun.\n- The Sterling submachine gun remained in use until 1994.\n- In 1994, the British Army phased out the Sterling submachine gun as the L85A1 assault rifle was phased in.",
